    "summary": "src/db/relations.ts: a resolved relationship whose target is not stored is kept as one pending row keyed makeUnresolvedRelationId(repo, from, kind, awaitedId) (meta awaitsId, class awaiting-target with reason target-not-stored-yet or external-endpoint for a boundary kind, absolute file, repo), indexed in unresolved_by_target; a missing source or unknown kind is counted unwritable against meta.repo or daemon-wide and logged at warn. Pending writes count every row by class and count their drops (pending-without-file, repository-not-registered). promoteResolvedBatch (and promoteToResolved through it) re-keys a row kept awaiting, removes a stale one, advances the generation once per repository and returns { promoted, keptAwaiting, unwritable }; its three production callers ignore the value. Evidence: docs/epics/complete-consistent-richer-code-index-one-E20261011c2ba6fa6/S001/evidence/t3-suites.md (db, indexer, daemon, analyze: 2257 tests; a re-run 2150 pass, 0 fail, 104 skipped; one flaky audit failure in the first run explained; three falsifying mutations).",
